# The ihp-sg13g2 files a mixed co-simulation case reads for a transistor-level sg13g2 die
# (Dockerfile, stage sg13g2-models). The case names the corner sections the root lines below
# name, and the stdcell spice. ngspice reads each named library whole and resolves every include
# in it, in every section, so the list is the closure of every .include, .inc and .lib reference
# in every reached file, all sections, recursively, from these roots; ci/check_sg13g2_models.py
# recomputes it at SG13G2_REF and requires this list to equal it. sha256 and path under the
# IHP-Open-PDK checkout, as sha256sum prints them, sorted by path (C order). The stage fetches
# exactly these at SG13G2_REF and checks each.
# root: ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_tt
# root: ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_ss
# root: ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_tt
